Template: kiyoshi-packages-repo/channel
Type: select
Choices: none, stable, beta
Default: none
Description: XLibre channel to enable:
 The repository always offers the Kiyoshi programs. Choose which XiS and XLibre X
 servers channel to enable as well: "stable" (XLibre 25.1), "beta" (XLibre 25.2)
 or "none" for the programs only. Enable at most one.
